window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The sixth and final book in the #1 internationally bestselling Demigods of San Francisco series!</p><p></p><p>It's the moment Kieran and Lexi have been preparing for. The Magical Summit.</p><p></p><p>Ready or not, they will take their assembled team into the belly of the beast. The stakes couldn't be higher. If the powers that be don't approve of Kieran, he will not earn the official title of the Demigod of San Francisco.</p><p></p><p>The real danger concerns Lexi, however. With Kieran away in meetings, she must brave the treacherous halls of the Summit with just her crew and her wards, fighting for social placement and status, open to attack from all angles.</p><p></p><p>She could've never expected what comes at her. No one could've.</p><p></p><p>Prepare yourself for this epic conclusion!</p><p></p><p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p><p></p><p>Performed by Yenni Ann, Yasmin Tuazon, Alex Hill-Knight, Sura Siu, Robb Moreira, Holly Adams, Rayner Gabriel, Danny Montooth, Christopher Walker, John Kielty, RJ Bayley, Aure Nash, Bradley Foster Smith, Carolyn Kashner, Christopher Williams, Damon Alums, Danny Gavigan, David Cui Cui, Debi Tinsley, Donald Guzzi, Drew Kopas, Elena Anderson, Emlyn McFarland, Eric Messner, Gabriel Michael, Henry W. Kramer, James Konicek, Jameson Hunt, Jeri J. Marshall, Joey Sourlis, Jonathan David Bullock, Jonathan Sleep, Jonathon Church, Karen Novack, Kay Elúvian, Marissa Clay, Matthew Bassett, Matthew Pauli, Megan Hastie, Michael Glenn, Michael John Casey, Nathaniel Priestley, Nora Achrati, Ryan Haugen, Samantha Cooper, Sara Greenfield, Sarah Ruth Thomas, Shanta Parasuraman, Sheree Wichard, Stewart Crank, Terence Aselford, Troy Allan, Wyn Delano, and Zura Johnson.</p>"; 
